%% Announced load shedding: Pre-outage, cut, backup, staggered restoration.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as DISCOM
    participant C7 as Battery orchestrator (C7)
    participant C14 as Messaging (C14)
    participant HH as Households
    participant BAT as Battery blocks
    participant SEN as Sensors (C1)
    participant C9 as Outage + backup (C9)
    participant CP as Critical premises (6)
    D->>C7: load-shedding notice (14:00): cut 19:40–21:10
    C7->>C7: mode Normal → Pre-outage (owner C7)
    C7->>BAT: raise floor to backup need ×1.5, keep shaving with the rest
    C14->>HH: SMS to 150 homes: charge phones / inverters now
    D->>SEN: 19:40 supply cut
    SEN->>C9: power-fail on all 6 sensors (instant)
    BAT->>BAT: inverters anti-island (IEC 62116), grid relay opens
    C9->>C9: mode → Backup (owner C9)
    C9->>CP: set current limits by priority (clinic 16 A first)
    BAT->>CP: supply over the backup circuit only
    D->>SEN: 21:10 supply restored
    C9->>C9: mode → Restoration
    C9->>CP: re-transfer to grid in batches (no cold-load surge)
    C9->>C7: mode → Normal, hand back to planning
